idjQEvEw","date":"2019-11-08T19:00:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9296290278434753,"text_excerpt":"Zero complaints from me when it comes to staying at this hotel! The rooms were all brand-new looking and came with nice comfortable furniture, it was in the perfect location for doing things, and the staff were all super friendly. Our room had a balcony that overlooked the pool and city which was quite nice as well. I would stay here again if I was in the area. I will say though I was somewhat annoyed at the booking process. I missed reserving in a block of rooms by 2 days and was not offered the price (which I'm sure is policy blah blah blah), but it left a bad taste in my mouth. The hotel was nearly booked due to the block so they made their moneys worth. I ended up having to get a non-..."},{"business_id":"Zp2_GDbmKT7YCA04ygIHZg","review_id":"RSG_vZHLvAwbqtLuE452Hg","date":"2013-12-20T11:43:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9179884195327759,"text_excerpt":"We really like this place. It is in a great location right off the french quarters. The rooms are really nice and the staff was really friendly. I would recommend this place to anyone trying to save a few bucks, wanting to be close the quarter but okay that they are not smack dab in the middle of it."},{"business_id":"Zp2_GDbmKT7YCA04ygIHZg","review_id":"uIN95_0u6izmGibwAPZFlQ","date":"2017-12-28T15:03:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9160088300704956,"text_excerpt":"I got this hotel through Hotwire when we spent the night in NOLA on our way to Alabama. I was pleasantly surprised how nice is was! The staff was very friendly, got us checked in right away and the room had a great view of downtown. Parking is a little steep at $30 but we parked on the street across from the hotel for free. It's worth looking for street parking if you want to save a little money."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
